[en.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_SWARM]
Swarm Emergence

[en.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_SWARM_desc]
Each individual only needs to do its own thing, and no individual has the will or obligation to interfere in national affairs. However, under a perfect rule, individuals who only need to take care of their immediate affairs automatically form a perfectly functioning social machine, as if there is a superconsciousness controlling everything.

[zh.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_SWARM]
涌现意志

[zh.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_SWARM_desc]
每个个体都只需要做好自己的事情，没有个体有意愿或者义务去干涉国家大事，然而在一个完美的规则下，一个个只需要顾及眼前事务的个体自动组成了一个完美运转的社会机器，仿佛存在一个超意识控制一般井井有条。
